'''Xerneas''' (Japanese: '''ゼルネアス''' ''Xerneas'') is a {{ct|Psychic}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Crimson Blaze}} expansion.

